# Polar ADMINISTRATION credentials — local tooling only, never shipped.
#
# The published CLI needs no secret at all: `lutrin license activate` talks to
# Polar's customer-portal endpoints, which are authenticated by the customer's
# own licence key. This token exists only to provision products, discount codes
# and checkout links from a maintainer's machine.
#
# Create an ORGANIZATION access token (production — sandbox is a separate
# environment) at https://polar.sh/dashboard/lutrin/settings with scopes:
#   products:read   discounts:write   checkout_links:write
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill it in there. .env is gitignored.
POLAR_ACCESS_TOKEN=
